Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:32:21 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] tests: packet validation, overlay, color pipeline and
 cross-codec checks

- packet-validation (CTest, CPU only): malformed coefficient packets.
- pyrowave-overlay-test, pyrowave-color-pipeline-test: GPU checks of
  layer compositing, failed-encode completion and color conversion,
  registered with -DPYROWAVE_GPU_TESTS=ON.
- pyrowave-cross-codec-test (-DPYROWAVE_CROSS_CODEC_TESTS=ON): encodes
  and decodes fixtures across two library builds; tests/README.md
  describes the fixtures.
- pyrowave-stage-bench: per-stage GPU timings and decoded-output hashes
  for shader work.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
